Definition.
- In these regulations, unless the context otherwise requires,-
(a)
"Act" means the Pre-natal Diagnostic Techniques (Regulation and Prevention of Misuse) Act, 1994 (
57 of 1994
);
(b)
"rules" means any rules framed under the Act;
(c)
"Board"means the Central Supervisory Board constituted under section 7 of the Act;
(d)
"meeting" means meeting of the Board;
(e)
"Member" 'means a member of the Board;
(f)
words and expression used herein and not defined in these regulations but defined in the act or rules shall have the
same meanings so assigned to them in the Act or rules.
